WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:09,230
Information: Under the classroom podium, under the third red brick, there is a key that can open the front door of the classroom.

2
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:12,100
Key? Open the door?

3
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:23,060
Who is this?

4
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,100
Two, on their side.

5
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:42,260
All the people who were keeping vigil came over last night.

6
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:52,930
One by one, they said what they saw last night.

7
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:55,930
I was watching the first half of the night. Everyone here was asleep and no one got up.

8
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:59,930
I was watching in the second half of the night, and I kept watching. Indeed, no one on our side got up.

9
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:06,840
What about over there? Did any of you look over there last night?
